WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
It is morning in a small West Virginia town.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.900
This is Jess. She's a mom of two,
getting lunches packed

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.900
and backpacks zipped before the school bus arrives.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.400
She is also stepping into a hopeful new chapter today

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.000
because she just started a new job.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.700
During her break at work, Jess checks her phone.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.700
The screen shows a standard payday notification,

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.700
but every payday, her money already has a job:

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.800
rent, lights, gas, groceries, and the kids.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.300
Then life happens. A flat tire on the drive home.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.500
A sick day. A bill nobody saw coming.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Jess looks at the car, worried but entirely calm.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Later that evening, the kids tackle their homework

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.400
at the kitchen table while Jess sits quietly,
thinking through the numbers.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.100
Jess wants a cushion, just enough that one bad week
doesn't turn into a crisis.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.900
Can you help her build it?

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:56.200
Welcome to the Cushion Challenge.
